atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.BadPbufStore  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Give amc singular fpbuf fields with and without a Set, and check that amc rejects the three without one"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.BadPbufSyntax  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:memcheckB  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Give amc cpbuf ctypes with a misspelled, empty, proto2 and proto3 syntax, and check the rejections and encoders"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.BadPbufType  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Give amc an fpbuf field whose pb_type has no amcdb.pbtype row, and check that amc rejects it"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.BadPmaskMember  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Give amc pmask member rows naming fields with no presence bit, and check that amc rejects each by name"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.BadPmaskWidth  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Give amc a u8 pmask over nine member fields, and check that amc rejects it"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.BadProj  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:memcheckB  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Give amc three projected ctypes no codec can write, and check that each is refused by name before any emitter"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.BadSizeCycle  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Give amc ctypes that contain each other by value, and check that amc reports each defect and ends without hanging"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.BadSizeOverflow  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Give amc an Inlary whose total size passes the i32 range, and check that amc reports a clean error"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.BadSmallstrToobig  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Give amc rpascal strings longer than 255, and check that amc rejects both and exits 2"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.BadTsWire  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:memcheckB  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Give amc packed TypeScript ctypes with fields of no wire form, and check that each is refused before any write"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.BadVarlenLast  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Give amc fields of every shape after a Varlen field, and check that amc rejects those that declare a member"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.BadVarlenOpt  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Give amc ctypes that claim the end of the fixed portion twice, and check one rejection each and the controls"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.BitfldReadRange  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:memcheckB  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate readers for bitfields of each arg type and width, and check which carry a store-range bound"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.CopyctorInit  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:memcheckB  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate a copy constructor from inlary Init macros and defaults, and check how each names the record"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.CursUnrequested  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:memcheckB  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate a bitset with no tcurs rows and no fcurs request, and check that amc emits NBits and no bitcurs cursor"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.DfltRetarget  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:memcheckB  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate Init from defaults naming *this and this, and check that each is retargeted and *thisvalue survives"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.DispfilterFieldPrint  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:memcheckB  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate a dispatch filter over an fconst message field, and check that its regx match calls the field's Print"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.DispfilterMatchAll  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:memcheckB  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate a match_all dispatch filter over two messages, and check every message-side expression in Match"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.EditFail  timeout:30  cijob:compB  memcheck:memcheckB  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Run amc -e with an editor that fails, and check that amc reports the failure and skips code generation"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.FastPmaskName  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:memcheckB  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate a FAST codec whose pmask has another name, then drop the state pmask, and check the names and the error"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.FconstBitfldWidth  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Give amc fconst values on bitfields of every width, and check that each range comes from the declared width"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.FconstGlobal  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:memcheckB  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate fconst accessors on a field of a global ctype, and check that they call each other with no parent"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.FdecGetScale  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:memcheckB  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate fdec fields on one- and two-fdec ctypes, and check that only the first gets a ctype-named GetScale"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.FdecGlobalBitfld  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:memcheckB  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate fdec accessors on bitfields of a global ctype, and check the parentless calls and the width bound"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.FstepAlias  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate an executable that steps a library list through an Alias field, and check its Steps()"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.FstepAliasOverride  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate an alias step over a library list that has its own step, and check that Steps() calls only the alias"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.FstepBand  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate steps in several bands and namespaces, and check that Steps() runs them band by band in dependency order"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.FstepIdleRate  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate an idle step with no fsteprate row, and check that it runs one call in eight passes"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.FstepRate  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate an idle step with rate 2/3, and check the credit it earns per pass and its run on an idle pass"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.FstepScaleBlkhash  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate InlineRecur steps with fdelay scale:Y on a Blkhash and a Lary field, and check that amc accepts both"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.FstepTimehookIdle  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:none  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate an idle-band time hook step, and check that it arms its hook on algo_lib's idle heap"
atfdb.comptest  comptest:amc.GconstIndir  timeout:10  cijob:compB  memcheck:memcheckB  coverage:Y  stablefld:N  comment:"Generate a gconst whose value table lives in the -in_dir universe, and check that amc loads it with no sideload notice"
